<Base title="Partners" description="Some pages link to Agoda, 12Go, or Vietnam Railways so you can check a stay, a bus, or a train. Those blocks say Partner link. Partner clicks are not part of visit rank." path="/about/partners">
  <article class="wrap reading section">
    <h1>Partners</h1>
    <p>Some pages link to Agoda, 12Go, or Vietnam Railways so you can check a stay, a bus, or a train. Those blocks say “Partner link.” If you book through a partner link, the site may earn a commission. The official railway link is included even when a commercial search sits beside it.</p>
    <p>Partner clicks are not part of visit rank. A partner cannot buy dots. Display ads are not switched on. When they are, they will sit below the fact bar and will not appear on visa, storm, or accessibility pages.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
